{
  "Combat.Marae.HandleFear.MaraeSnarls": "[say: You think I'm afraid of anything? Foolish mortal.] Marae snarls.[pg]"
  "Combat.Marae.RunCheck.ItLooksLike": "It looks like you cannot escape. "
  "Combat.Marae.RunCheck.YouGritYour": "You grit your teeth with effort as you try to fly away but the tentacles suddenly grab your [legs] and pull you down. "
  "Combat.Marae.RunCheck.YouMayNot": "You may not be able to swim fast enough. "
  "Combat.Marae.RunCheck.YourBoatIs": "Your boat is blocked by tentacles! "
  "Combat.Marae.Smite.MaraeMouthsA": "Marae mouths a chant. The clouds gather and quickly darkens. <b>It looks like a lightning might strike you!</b>"
  "Combat.Marae.SmiteHit.TheIntensityOf": " The intensity of the pain is unbearable."
  "Combat.Marae.SmiteHit.WithoutWarningThe": "Without warning, the lightning hits you! Surge of electricity rushes through you painfully."
  "Combat.Marae.SmiteHit.YouLookUp": "You look up in the sky to see the lightning incoming! Thanks to your preparedness, you manage to leap away before the lightning hits you! "
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleAttack.AndYouSuccessfully": "and you successfully dodge her tentacles!"
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleAttack.AndYouSuccessfully2": "and you successfully dodge her tentacles thanks to your superior evasion!"
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleAttack.ButYouFail": "but you fail and get hit instead! The feel of the tentacles left your groin slightly warmer."
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleAttack.YouSpotBarrage": "You spot barrage of tentacles coming your way! You attempt to dodge your way out "
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleRape.YouAttemptTo": "You attempt to slap away the tentacles but it's too late! The tentacles tickle your groin and you can feel your [ass] being teased! [say: You know you want me!] Marae giggles."
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleRape.YouManageTo": "You manage to successfully run from her tentacles! "
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleRape.YouManageTo2": "You manage to avoid her tentacles thanks to your superior evasion!"
  "Combat.Marae.TentacleRape.YouSpotBarrage": "You spot barrage of tentacles coming your way! The tentacles are coming your way, aiming for your groin! "
